    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark forces threaten the peaceful realm of Valora, and its villages cry out for protection. Answer the call as a legendary hero tasked with defending the realm's most vulnerable settlements. In this strategic turn-based deck-building game, your decisions will determine the fate of countless lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/7ef1089ac74cc8c13e36c6cb48b929d1.poster.avif?t=1744668768\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/7ef1089ac74cc8c13e36c6cb48b929d1.webm?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/7ef1089ac74cc8c13e36c6cb48b929d1.mp4?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC DEPTH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct powerful structures, from mighty towers to specialized resource buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy and command diverse troops with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage crucial resources including Wood, Stone, Iron, and Gold to fund your defensive efforts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECK-BUILDING MASTERY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your perfect deck through strategic card acquisition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful new buildings, troops, and abilities as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover synergistic combinations that enhance your defensive capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy with specialized cards that complement your chosen hero's strengths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/dd0ac1de793a7accac5a22fd1d69c337.poster.avif?t=1744668768\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/dd0ac1de793a7accac5a22fd1d69c337.webm?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/dd0ac1de793a7accac5a22fd1d69c337.mp4?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > EPIC JOURNEY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigate  your path through different villages</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face increasingly challenging threats as you venture deeper into corrupted territories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confront and defeat powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/51d64bf6b6efd9e5a375e5099fef7eb4.poster.avif?t=1744668768\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/51d64bf6b6efd9e5a375e5099fef7eb4.webm?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/51d64bf6b6efd9e5a375e5099fef7eb4.mp4?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DYNAMIC GAMEPLAY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every playthrough offers unique challenges and opportunities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple viable strategies for victory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Progressive difficulty scaling that tests your mastery of game mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark forces threaten the peaceful realm of Valora, and its villages cry out for protection. Answer the call as a legendary hero tasked with defending the realm's most vulnerable settlements. In this strategic turn-based deck-building game, your decisions will determine the fate of countless lives.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/7ef1089ac74cc8c13e36c6cb48b929d1.poster.avif?t=1744668768\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/7ef1089ac74cc8c13e36c6cb48b929d1.webm?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3341630/extras/7ef1089ac74cc8c13e36c6cb48b929d1.mp4?t=1744668768\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > </h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STRATEGIC DEPTH</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct powerful structures, from mighty towers to specialized resource buildings</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deploy and command diverse troops with unique abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage crucial resources including Wood, Stone, Iron, and Gold to fund your defensive efforts.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECK-BUILDING MASTERY</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your perfect deck through strategic card acquisition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock powerful new buildings, troops, and abilities as you progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover synergistic combinations that enhance your defensive capabilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt your strategy with specialized cards that complement your chosen hero's strengths</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>